{"seq":2,"slug":"business-and-culture","title":"商业与文化","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/elon-musk/influence-and-legacy/business-and-culture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-entrepreneur-icon","title":"企业家偶像","url":"/c/people/elon-musk/influence-and-legacy/business-and-culture/the-entrepreneur-icon","wordCount":1470,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-media-influence","title":"社交媒体的影响力","url":"/c/people/elon-musk/influence-and-legacy/business-and-culture/social-media-influence","wordCount":1539,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 商业与文化\n\n马斯克的影响，超越产业，深入商业文化与公众心理。本章考察这两个层面。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"企业家偶像\"——他如何成为创新、冒险与远见的象征，激励全球创业者。第二篇文档讲述\"社交媒体的影响力\",剖析他如何重塑企业家与公众沟通的方式，及其引发的震荡与争议。\n"}